---
title: API Center — Full Request Lifecycle
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client / SDK
    participant N as NGINX LB
    participant SM as SecurityMiddleware
    participant ML as MorganLogger
    participant CI as CorrelationID Interceptor
    participant RL as RateLimit Guard
    participant JA as JWT Auth Guard
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant AP as Auth Provider
    participant CT as Controller
    participant PH as ProxyHandler
    participant RG as RegistryService
    participant CB as CircuitBreaker
    participant UP as Upstream Service
    participant AL as AuditLog Interceptor
    participant MX as Metrics Interceptor
    participant EF as ExceptionFilter
    participant RD as Redis
    participant KF as Kafka

    C->>N: HTTP Request + Bearer JWT
    N->>SM: Forward (round-robin)
    SM->>SM: Check Content-Length under 5MB
    SM->>SM: Strip X-Powered-By, Server headers
    SM->>SM: Set Cache-Control, Security headers
    SM->>ML: Pass through
    ML->>ML: Log request via Winston
    ML->>CI: Enter NestJS pipeline

    CI->>CI: Read or generate X-Correlation-ID
    CI->>RL: Attach correlationId to req

    RL->>RD: Check throttler counter for tribeId
    RD-->>RL: Current count
    alt Rate limit exceeded
        RL-->>C: 429 Too Many Requests
    end
    RL->>JA: Under limit - proceed

    JA->>JA: Extract Bearer token
    JA->>AS: validateToken(token)
    AS->>AP: Provider-specific validation
    AP->>AP: Verify JWT signature + expiry
    AP-->>AS: JwtClaims
    AS-->>JA: Normalized claims
    alt Invalid token
        JA-->>EF: UnauthorizedError
        EF-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    JA->>JA: Attach req.user, req.tribeId
    JA->>CT: Authenticated request

    CT->>PH: proxyRequest(targetServiceId, req, res)

    PH->>RG: resolveUpstream(targetServiceId)
    RG->>RG: In-memory cache lookup
    alt Cache miss
        RG->>RD: Redis lookup
        RD-->>RG: Service manifest
    end
    RG-->>PH: baseUrl

    PH->>PH: Validate namespace (tribe/shared)
    PH->>PH: Lifecycle gate check
    alt Service retired
        PH-->>C: 410 Gone + replacement hint
    end

    PH->>RG: canConsume(tribeId, targetServiceId)
    alt Not authorized
        PH-->>C: 403 Forbidden
    end

    PH->>PH: Validate JWT scopes

    PH->>CB: tryAcquire()
    alt Circuit OPEN
        CB-->>PH: Rejected
        PH-->>C: 503 Service Unavailable
    end
    CB-->>PH: Acquired

    PH->>PH: Rewrite path + inject headers
    PH->>UP: Forward request
    UP-->>PH: Response

    alt 5xx response
        PH->>CB: recordFailure()
    else Success
        PH->>CB: recordSuccess()
    end

    PH-->>AL: Response flows back
    AL->>KF: Publish audit event (async)
    AL-->>MX: Continue
    MX->>MX: Record Prometheus metrics
    MX-->>C: Final HTTP Response + headers
